{"parentUuid":"c0a33bdb-99b6-4d81-970f-9229fff7572c","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"9bdfc07b-8ff1-4e95-9c88-de7440fd6192","agentId":"a247aee484158d5cb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EztrHUtpDgA9iiNrMFGxs2","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t## ARCH Engine architecture, governance & agent organization\n2\t # ARCH.REQ Requirements & configuration profiles\n3\t   ARCH.REQ.game-requirements | Capture target game requirements (genre, scale, platforms, online model) as engine requirements | engine-architect | E | \n4\t   ARCH.REQ.profiles | Engine configuration profiles & feature sets (indie 2D → AAA open-world online) | engine-architect | E | \n5\t   ARCH.REQ.hardware-tiers | Hardware tier definitions incl. server instance classes and refresh-rate classes | engine-architect | E | [[\"performance-architect\", \"dedicated-server\"]]\n6\t   ARCH.REQ.non-goals | Capability & non-goal register (radar non-goals) | engine-architect | E | \n7\t   ARCH.REQ.platform-matrix | Supported-target matrix (OS × ISA × GPU API × store × support tier) | engine-architect | E | [[\"platform-architect\", \"build-system-toolchains\", \"ci-cd-automation\", \"certification-compliance\"]]\n8\t # ARCH.STRUCT Structure & boundaries\n9\t   ARCH.STRUCT.layering | Layering rules & module boundaries | engine-architect | E | \n10\t   ARCH.STRUCT.contracts | Contract registry between subsystems | engine-architect | E | \n11\t   ARCH.STRUCT.build-buy | Build / integrate / buy decisions (middleware, OSS) | engine-architect | E | [[\"architecture-governance\"]]\n12\t   ARCH.STRUCT.replaceability | Subsystem replaceability & optionality (modules absent in small profiles) | engine-architect | E | \n13\t   ARCH.STRUCT.conventions | Global conventions: units, handedness, up-axis, coordinate spaces | engine-architect | E | [[\"math-simd-numerics\"]]\n14\t   ARCH.STRUCT.arbitration | Cross-domain arbitration & escalation of boundary disputes | engine-architect | E | \n15\t   ARCH.STRUCT.platform-backends | Registered platform backend slots (RHI, IO, audio endpoint, input, sockets, crash, save storage, service SDK, IME/a11y bridge) | platform-architect | E | [[\"architecture-governance\"]]\n16\t   ARCH.STRUCT.registration | Declarative self-registration for phases, render features, services, cvars, codegen inputs (no central tables) | engine-architect | E | [[\"frame-orchestration\", \"render-architect\"]]\n17\t   ARCH.STRUCT.binding | Contract binding policy: implementation chosen at compile/link/load time; batch-granular interfaces; no per-item virtual dispatch across contracts on hot paths | engine-architect | E | [[\"cpu-performance\", \"architecture-governance\"]]\n18\t # ARCH.GOV Architecture governance\n19\t   ARCH.GOV.adr | ADR lifecycle with evidence, alternatives, revisit conditions | architecture-governance | E | \n20\t   ARCH.GOV.fitness | Automated architectural fitness functions (layering, dependency, contract conformance) | architecture-governance | E | \n21\t   ARCH.GOV.anti-legacy | Anti-legacy review against the flagged-pattern catalogue (data/legacy-patterns.json) | architecture-governance | E | \n22\t   ARCH.GOV.radar | Technology radar (data/radar.json): maturity, owners, revisit triggers, non-goals | architecture-governance | E | [[\"research-evidence\"]]\n23\t   ARCH.GOV.process-tiers | Governance weight per organization tier (which ADR/CR/critic stages are mandatory) | architecture-governance | E | \n24\t # ARCH.EVID Research & evidence\n25\t   ARCH.EVID.grading | Source grading & provenance tiers | research-evidence | E | \n26\t   ARCH.EVID.survey | Literature survey protocol per decision | research-evidence | E | \n27\t   ARCH.EVID.spike | Prototype/spike protocol producing evidence where literature is thin | research-evidence | E | \n28\t   ARCH.EVID.claims | Benchmark-backed claims standard | research-evidence | E | [[\"perf-benchmarking\"]]\n29\t # ARCH.ORG Agent organization\n30\t   ARCH.ORG.decomposition | Milestone → task decomposition by skill territory | program-orchestration | E | \n31\t   ARCH.ORG.ownership-ledger | Ownership ledger & territory locks | program-orchestration | E | \n32\t   ARCH.ORG.integration | Integration sequencing & milestone vertical slices | program-orchestration | E | \n33\t   ARCH.ORG.change-requests | Contract change-request protocol between agents | program-orchestration | E | [[\"architecture-governance\"]]\n34\t   ARCH.ORG.critic-gates | Scheduling critic gates per stage | program-orchestration | E | \n35\t   ARCH.ORG.bootstrap | Walking-skeleton definition & bring-up order | program-orchestration | E | [[\"engine-architect\", \"platform-architect\", \"ci-cd-automation\"]]\n36\t   ARCH.ORG.milestones | Milestone ladder with per-milestone skill set, contract maturity & exit criteria (data/milestones.json) | program-orchestration | E | [[\"reference-games\"]]\n37\t   ARCH.ORG.write-sets | Module/file write-set convention & shared-file protocol | program-orchestration | E | [[\"build-system-toolchains\"]]\n38\t   ARCH.ORG.staffing | Agent staffing tiers: co-hosting of skills per organization scale (by workstream) | program-orchestration | E | \n39\t   ARCH.ORG.escalation | Escalation tiers & decision SLAs; delegated arbitration inside a lead's subtree | program-orchestration | E | [[\"engine-architect\"]]\n40\t   ARCH.ORG.human-gates | Register of decisions requiring human authorization (contracts, spend, NDA access, submissions, legal sign-off) | program-orchestration | E | [[\"engine-architect\", \"certification-compliance\"]]\n41\t   ARCH.ORG.risk | Program risk register & risk-driven milestone ordering | program-orchestration | E | [[\"research-evidence\"]]\n42\t   ARCH.ORG.triage | Failure attribution, bisection, routing to owners, revert-first policy | program-orchestration | E | [[\"ci-cd-automation\", \"perf-benchmarking\"]]\n43\t   ARCH.ORG.critic-calibration | Critic calibration via seeded defects; rounds count only above r