le | Portable-console integration | platform-console | E | \n89\t   PLAT.CON.cross-gen | Cross-generation SKUs & backward-compatibility modes | platform-console | E | \n90\t   PLAT.CON.rhi-backends | Console graphics API backends (confidential extensions implementing C-RHI) | platform-console | E | [[\"rhi-core\"]]\n91\t # PLAT.MOB Mobile & portable\n92\t   PLAT.MOB.os | iOS / Android integration | platform-mobile | E | \n93\t   PLAT.MOB.tbdr | Tile-based GPU implications (bandwidth, on-chip memory) | platform-mobile | E | [[\"render-graph-scheduling\"]]\n94\t   PLAT.MOB.thermal | Thermal & power adaptivity | platform-mobile | E | [[\"performance-architect\"]]\n95\t   PLAT.MOB.storage | Runtime storage constraints (free-space checks, OS cache purge) | platform-mobile | E | \n96\t   PLAT.MOB.frame-pacing | Mobile frame pacing & refresh-rate selection | platform-mobile | E | \n97\t   PLAT.MOB.notifications | Local & push notifications | platform-mobile | E | \n98\t   PLAT.MOB.links | Deep links & attribution boundary (ATT consent) | platform-mobile | E | \n99\t # PLAT.SVC Platform & online services integration\n100\t   PLAT.SVC.identity | User identity, sign-in, account linking, crossplay identity | platform-services | E | \n101\t   PLAT.SVC.achievements | Achievements, trophies, activities, rich presence | platform-services | E | \n102\t   PLAT.SVC.entitlements | Entitlements, store, DLC ownership | platform-services | E | \n103\t   PLAT.SVC.cloud-save | Cloud save services | platform-services | E | [[\"persistence-save\"]]\n104\t   PLAT.SVC.matchmaking | Matchmaking / lobby / session integration boundary | online-services-liveops | E | [[\"network-architect\"]]\n105\t   PLAT.SVC.remote-config | Remote configuration & feature flags | online-services-liveops | E | \n106\t   PLAT.SVC.moderation | Moderation boundary (UGC, chat, generated content) | online-services-liveops | E | [[\"modding-ugc\"]]\n107\t   PLAT.SVC.capture | Media capture & share integration | platform