ting-runtime\"]]\n159\t   CORE.LIFE.ipc | Engine IPC/RPC transport & process model for tools, workers, crash handler, profiler | core-runtime-architect | E | [[\"editor-architect\", \"crash-diagnostics\", \"security-engineering\"]]\n160\t   CORE.LIFE.config-snapshots | Config reads via immutable snapshots latched at sync points; queued change notification | core-runtime-architect | E | [[\"frame-orchestration\"]]\n161\t   CORE.LIFE.interop | Multi-language interop & memory-safe components (FFI/ABI rules, ownership across boundaries) | core-runtime-architect | M | [[\"security-engineering\", \"build-system-toolchains\"]]\n162\t # CORE.MATH Math & numerics\n163\t   CORE.MATH.linear | SIMD linear algebra (vectors, matrices, quaternions) | math-simd-numerics | E | \n164\t   CORE.MATH.geometry | Geometry primitives & intersection tests | math-simd-numerics | E | \n165\t   CORE.MATH.compgeo | Computational geometry (hulls, triangulation, booleans) | math-simd-numerics | E | \n166\t   CORE.MATH.robustness | Numerical robustness & precision analysis | math-simd-numerics | E | \n167\t   CORE.MATH.precision | Double & mixed-precision math for large worlds | math-simd-numerics | E | [[\"spatial-transforms\"]]\n168\t   CORE.MATH.deterministic | Cross-platform reproducible math library | math-simd-numerics | E | [[\"determinism-replay\"]]\n169\t   CORE.MATH.random | Random numbers & noise functions | math-simd-numerics | E | \n170\t   CORE.MATH.curves | Curves, splines & interpolation | math-simd-numerics | E | \n171\t   CORE.MATH.spmd | Wide-SIMD / SPMD kernels for fixed and scalable (VLA) vector ISAs, runtime ISA dispatch | math-simd-numerics | E | [[\"cpu-performance\"]]\n172\t   CORE.MATH.formats | Half, packed & quantized numeric formats | math-simd-numerics | E | \n173\t # CORE.MEM Memory\n174\t   CORE.MEM.virtual | Virtual memory reservation & mapping | memory-allocators | E | \n175\t   CORE.MEM.allocators | Allocator families (linear/frame, pool, TLSF, slab, buddy) | mem