ng (C-REPLAY) | determinism-replay | E | [[\"input-system\", \"replication\", \"visual-debugging-tools\"]]\n1256\t   XC.DET.conformance | Determinism conformance matrix (toolchain × ISA × platform × cores × schedule) as CI gate | determinism-replay | E | [[\"ci-cd-automation\", \"test-architect\", \"robustness-fuzzing\"]]\n1257\t   XC.DET.external-inputs | Recording nondeterministic external results (services, model outputs) into replays | determinism-replay | E | \n1258\t # XC.ITER Hot reload & iteration\n1259\t   XC.ITER.protocol | Reload protocol & state preservation | hot-reload-iteration | E | \n1260\t   XC.ITER.live-coding | C++ live coding | hot-reload-iteration | E | \n1261\t   XC.ITER.coordination | Asset, shader, script & config reload coordination | hot-reload-iteration | E | \n1262\t   XC.ITER.metrics | Iteration-time metrics (edit → see latency) | hot-reload-iteration | E | [[\"developer-experience-docs\"]]\n1263\t # XC.SEC Security\n1264\t   XC.SEC.threats | Threat modeling | security-engineering | E | \n1265\t   XC.SEC.coding | Secure coding & memory-safety policy | security-engineering | E | \n1266\t   XC.SEC.trust | Trust boundaries for untrusted input | security-engineering | E | \n1267\t   XC.SEC.supply-chain | Supply-chain security (SBOM, signing, reproducible builds) | security-engineering | E | [[\"build-system-toolchains\"]]\n1268\t   XC.SEC.secrets | Secrets management | security-engineering | E | [[\"ci-cd-automation\"]]\n1269\t   XC.SEC.tamper | Anti-tamper & DRM boundary | security-engineering | E | [[\"anti-cheat-integrity\"]]\n1270\t   XC.SEC.privacy | Privacy engineering | security-engineering | E | \n1271\t   XC.SEC.sandbox | Mod / UGC sandbox policy | security-engineering | E | [[\"modding-ugc\"]]\n1272\t   XC.SEC.server-validation | Server-side cheat validation | anti-cheat-integrity | E | [[], [\"online\"]]\n1273\t   XC.SEC.anticheat | Client anti-cheat middleware integration boundary | anti-cheat-integrity | E | [[], [\"online\"]]\