 tool: []  impl: []\n389\t=== audio-content-runtime [expert/runtime/Audio Content Runtime] parent=audio-architect ws=audio profiles=['all'] targets=['client', 'tools'] plats=None\n390\t  purpose: Audio event system and parameters, interactive music, dialogue and VO, authoring tool integration, audio-to-haptics.\n391\t  nonresp: Localization pipeline -> localization-i18n || Haptics devices -> input-devices-haptics\n392\t  provides: []  consumes: ['C-AUDIO', 'C-ASSET', 'C-LOC', 'C-DIALOGUE?', 'C-DEVICE?', 'C-ML?', 'C-A11Y']  tool: ['C-GRAPH', 'C-EDCMD', 'C-EDHOST']  impl: []\n393\t=== network-architect [lead/runtime/Network Architect] parent=engine-architect ws=online profiles=['online'] targets=['client', 'headless-client', 'server', 'tools'] plats=None\n394\t  purpose: Netcode model per game type (authoritative server, lockstep, rollback, P2P/relay), network tick and time, authority model, budgets and scale targets, protocol versioning, sharded worlds evaluation.\n395\t  nonresp: Transport -> network-transport || Replication mechanics -> replication || Matchmaking services -> platform-services\n396\t  provides: ['C-NET']  consumes: ['C-FRAME', 'C-SER', 'C-DET', 'C-ID', 'C-ECS?', 'C-RELEASE']  tool: []  impl: []\n397\t=== network-transport [expert/runtime/Network Transport] parent=network-architect ws=online profiles=['online'] targets=['client', 'headless-client', 'server', 'tools'] plats=None\n398\t  purpose: UDP sockets and platform network APIs, reliability and ordering, fragmentation, congestion control, encryption and authentication, NAT traversal and relays, connection lifecycle, link simulation, QUIC/WebTransport evaluation.\n399\t  nonresp: What is replicated -> replication || Relay service operation -> platform-services\n400\t  provides: ['C-NETLINK']  consumes: ['C-PAL', 'C-TASK']  tool: []  impl: []\n401\t=== replication [expert/runtime/Replication & State Sync] parent=network-architect ws=online profiles=['online'] targets=['client', 'headless-client', 'server', 'tools'] plats=None\n402\t  purpose: Entity and property replication, delta compression and quantization, interest management, prioritization, RPCs, snapshot interpolation, replay recording, network ID mapping.\n403\t  nonresp: Prediction -> prediction-rollback || Transport -> network-transport\n404\t  provides: ['C-REP']  consumes: ['C-NET', 'C-NETLINK', 'C-ECS?', 'C-SER', 'C-ID', 'C-SPATIAL', 'C-WORLD?', 'C-SIGNIF?', 'C-REPLAY?']  tool: []  impl: []\n405\t=== prediction-rollback [expert/runtime/Prediction, Rollback & Lag Compensation] parent=network-architect ws=online profiles=['online'] targets=['client', 'headless-client', 'server', 'tools'] plats=None\n406\t  purpose: Client prediction and reconciliation, rollback netcode, lag compensation, deterministic lockstep, networked physics, clock synchronization.\n407\t  nonresp: Determinism rules -> determinism-replay || Physics solver -> rigid-body-dynamics\n408\t  provides: ['C-PREDICT']  consumes: ['C-NET', 'C-REP', 'C-DET', 'C-SNAPSHOT', 'C-INPUT', 'C-ECS?', 'C-PHYS?', 'C-ANIM?']  tool: []  impl: []\n409\t=== dedicated-server [expert/runtime/Dedicated Servers] parent=network-architect ws=online profiles=['online'] targets=['server', 'tools'] plats=None\n410\t  purpose: Headless server builds and stripping, tick cost and multi-instance density, fleet orchestration boundary, server observability, listen servers and host migration.\n411\t  nonresp: Fleet operation (outside engine scope) -> platform-services || Server logging substrate -> observability-telemetry\n412\t  provides: []  consumes: ['C-NET', 'C-NETLINK', 'C-FRAME', 'C-SVC?', 'C-LIVE', 'C-WORLD?']  tool: []  impl: []\n413\t=== gameplay-architect [lead/runtime/Gameplay Framework Architect] parent=engine-architect ws=gameplay profiles=['all'] targets=['client', 'headless-client', 'server', 'tools'] plats=None\n414\t  purpose: Gameplay framework: rules, players and possession, extension points and game-module structure, game flow and transitions, local players.\n415\t  nonresp: Abilities/tags/volumes toolkit -> gameplay-systems-toolkit || Scripting VM -> scripting-runtime || Game-specific code -> external:game-team\n416\t  provides: ['C-GAME']  consumes: ['C-ID', 'C-FRAME', 'C-TASK', 'C-ECS?', 'C-INPUT?', 'C-PHYS?', 'C-ANIM?', 'C-AUDIO?', 'C-NET?', 'C-REP?', 'C-WORLD?', 'C-SAVE?', 'C-UI?', 'C-VIEW?', 'C-A11Y', 'C-AIAGENT?']  tool: []  impl: []\n417\t=== gameplay-systems-toolkit [expert/runtime/Gameplay Systems Toolkit] parent=gameplay-architect ws=gameplay profiles=['all'] targets=['client', 'headless-client', 'server', 'tools'] plats=None\n418\t  purpose: Reusable gameplay systems: abilities, effects and attributes, gameplay tags, camera system, spawning and pooling, gameplay message routing, photo mode.\n419\t  nonresp: Generic events -> entity-object-model || Cinematic cameras -> cinematics-sequencer\n420\t  provides: []  consumes: ['C-GAME', 'C-VIEW', 'C-PHYS?', 'C-ANIM?', 'C-AUDIO?', 'C-DEVICE?', 'C-PREDICT?', 'C-REP?', 'C-INPUT?', 'C-GAMEDATA', 'C-A11Y']  tool: ['C-EDCMD', 'C-EDHOST']  impl: []\n421\t=== scripting-runtime [expert/runtime/Scripting Runtime] parent=gameplay-architect ws=gameplay profiles=['all'] targets=['client', 'headless-client', 'server', 'tools'] plats=None\n422\t  purpose: Scripting language selection, VM embedding and bindings, sandboxing, debugging and profiling, hot reload, visual scripting, AOT/JIT constraints, GC policy.\n423\t  nonresp: Reflection substrate -> reflection-metadata || Graph editor UI -> graph-editor-framework\n424\t  provides: ['C-SCRIPT']  consumes: ['C-REFL', 'C-RELOAD?', 'C-TASK', 'C-LIFETIME']  tool: ['C-GRAPH']  impl: []\n425\t=== navigation-pathfinding [expert/runtime/Navigation & Pathfinding] parent=gameplay-architect ws=gameplay profiles=['min2d', 'lite3d', 'std3d'] targets=['client', 'headless-client', 'server', 'tools'] plats=None\n426\t  purpose: Navmesh generation (tiled, runtime rebuild), grid and hierarchical pathfinding, path following, off-mesh links, 3D/volumetric navigation.\n427\t  nonresp: Crowd avoidance -> crowd-simulation || Decision making -> ai-behavior-perception\n428\t  provides: ['C-NAV']  consumes: ['C-SPATIAL', 'C-PHYS?', 'C-WORLD?', 'C-TASK', 'C-ENV?']  tool: ['C-COOK', 'C-EDCMD', 'C-EDHOST']  impl: []\n429\t=== crowd-simulation [expert/runtime/Crowd Simulation] parent=gameplay-architect ws=gameplay profiles=['openworld', 'massim'] targets=['client', 'headless-client', 'server', 'tools'] plats=None\n430\t  purpose: Flow fields, crowd avoidance, mass-agent simulation and LOD.\n431\t  nonresp: Navmesh -> navigation-pathfinding || Individual AI decisions -> ai-behavior-perception\n432\t  provides: []  consumes: ['C-NAV', 'C-ECS', 'C-SPATIAL']  tool: []  impl: []\n433\t=== ai-behavior-perception [expert/runtime/AI Behavior & Perception] parent=gameplay-architect ws=gameplay profiles=['all'] targets=['client', 'headless-client', 'server', 'tools'] plats=None\n434\t  purpose: Decision making (behavior trees, utility, HTN/GOAP, state trees), perception, environment queries, smart objects, AI scheduling and LOD; evaluates learned and LLM-driven agents.\n435\t  nonresp: Navigation -> navigation-pathfinding || ML runtime -> ml-inference-runtime\n436\t  provides: ['C-AIAGENT']  consumes: ['C-GAME', 'C-NAV?', 'C-SPATIAL', 'C-PHYS?', 'C-ML?', 'C-LIVE?', 'C-DIALOGUE?', 'C-SIGNIF?']  tool: ['C-GRAPH', 'C-EDCMD', 'C-EDHOST']  impl: []\n437\t=== persistence-save [expert/runtime/Persistence & Save Games] parent=gameplay-architect ws=gameplay profiles=['all'] targets=['client', 'headless-client', 'server', 'tools'] plats=None\n438\t  purpose: Save-game model and serialization, save versioning and migration, atomic writes, platform save APIs and quotas, cloud-save sync, persistent world-state deltas, checkpoints.\n439\t  nonresp: Schema evolution mechanism -> serialization-schema || Cloud service API -> platform-services\n440\t  provides: ['C-SAVE']  consumes: ['C-SER', 'C-ID', 'C-SVC?', 'C-WORLD?', 'C-CFG']  tool: []  impl: []\n441\t=== ui-architect [lead/runtime/UI Architect] parent=engine-architect ws=ui profiles=['all'] targets=['client', 'tools'] plats=None\n442\t  purpose: UI architecture (retained with data binding for game UI, immediate for developer UI), layout, styling, focus and navigation, animation, in-world UI, designer tool logic, UI performance.\n443\t  nonresp: UI draw backend -> render-2d-vector || Text shaping -> text-fonts || Editor panels -> editor-ui-framework\n444\t  provides: ['C-UI']  consumes: ['C-REFL', 'C-INPUT', 'C-DRAW2D', 'C-TEXT', 'C-LOC', 'C-A11YRT', 'C-AUDIO?', 'C-VIDEO?', 'C-PAL', 'C-A11Y']  tool: ['C-EDCMD', 'C-EDHOST']  impl: []\n445\t=== text-fonts [expert/runtime/Text & Fonts] parent=ui-architect ws=ui profiles=['all'] targets=['client', 'tools'] plats=None\n446\t  purpose: Font loading and fallback, glyph rasterization, shaping, bidi and line breaking, rich text and emoji, text input and IME.\n447\t  nonresp: String content -> localization-i18n || 2D draw submission -> render-2d-vector\n448\t  provides: ['C-TEXT']  consumes: ['C-TYPES', 'C-ASSET', 'C-A11Y']  tool: []  impl: []\n449\t=== localization-i18n [expert/runtime/Localization & Internationalization] parent=ui-architect ws=ui profiles=['all'] targets=['client', 'headless-client', 'server', 'tools'] plats=None\n450\t  purpose: String tables, ICU-class message formatting, CLDR locale formatting, localization pipeline, pseudo-localization, localized asset variants, culturalization.\n451\t  nonresp: Glyph rendering -> text-fonts || VO playback -> audio-content-runtime\n452\t  provides: ['C-LOC']  consumes: ['C-ASSET', 'C-TEXT?', 'C-VFS?']  tool: ['C-COOK']  impl: []\n453\t=== editor-architect [lead/tool/Editor Architect] parent=engine-architect ws=tools profiles=['all'] targets=['tools'] plats=None\n454\t  purpose: Editor architecture: process model (in- vs out-of-process runtime), editor/runtime data separation, transactions and undo/redo, selection, extension API and tool scripting, play-in-editor isolation, remote live editing, headless editor, large-project performance.\n455\t  nonresp: Panels and inspectors -> editor-ui-framework || World viewport tools -> world-editor-viewport || Source control -> collaboration-version-control\n456\t  provides: ['C-EDCMD']  consumes: ['C-REFL', 'C-SER', 'C-ASSET', 'C-WORLD', 'C-PLUGIN', 'C-UI?', 'C-IPC', 'C-NET?', 'C-REP?']  tool: []  impl: []\n457\t=== editor-ui-framework [expert/tool/Editor UI Framework] parent=editor-architect ws=tools profiles=['all'] targets=['tools'] plats=None\n458\t  purpose: Tool UI toolkit (docking, panels), reflection-driven inspectors, asset browser, immediate-mode developer UI, editor UX standards.\n459\t  nonresp: Game UI -> ui-architect || Graph editors -> graph-editor-framework\n460\t  provides: ['C-EDHOST']  consumes: ['C-EDCMD', 'C-REFL', 'C-DRAW2D', 'C-TEXT', 'C-DEVUI?']  tool: []  impl: []\n461\t=== world-editor-viewport [expert/tool/World Editor & Viewport] parent=editor-architect ws=tools profiles=['all'] targets=['tools'] plats=None\n462\t  purpose: Viewport and navigation, gizmos, snapping and placement, partition-aware world editing, spline tools, environment tool-mode hosting.\n463\t  nonresp: Terrain tool logic -> terrain || World format -> world-data-model\n464\t  provides: []  consumes: ['C-EDCMD', 'C-EDHOST', 'C-WORLD', 'C-RSCENE', 'C-SPATIAL', 'C-VIEW']  tool: []  impl: []\n465\t=== graph-editor-framework [expert/tool/Graph Editor Framework] parent=editor-architect ws=tools profiles=['all'] targets=['tools'] plats=None\n466\t  purpose: Shared node-graph editor for material, animation, VFX, audio, PCG and visual-script graphs: framework, compile/validation contract, debugging, diff and merge.\n467\t  nonresp: Each domain's graph semantics -> ['material-system', 'animation-graphs', 'vfx-particles', 'audio-content-runtime', 'procedural-generation', 'scripting-runtime', 'ai-behavior-perception', 'narrative-dialogue']\n468\t  provides: ['C-GRAPH']  consumes: ['C-