ated/synced per object per frame\", \"default_stance\": \"Change-tracked delta extraction, O(changes)\", \"justification_owner\": \"render-architect\"}\n\nlegacy-patterns {\"id\": \"L15\", \"pattern\": \"Frame-tied resource lifetimes\", \"detection\": \"resources freed at end of frame/level\", \"default_stance\": \"Explicit lifetimes + retirement keyed to completion tokens\", \"justification_owner\": \"resource-streaming-architect\"}\n\nlegacy-patterns {\"id\": \"L16\", \"pattern\": \"Synchronous IO / blocking loads\", \"detection\": \"file read on a frame-critical thread\", \"default_stance\": \"Async staged pipeline with deadlines\", \"justification_owner\": \"async-io-storage\"}\n\nlegacy-patterns {\"id\": \"L17\", \"pattern\": \"Page-fault-driven streaming\", \"detection\": \"mmap reads on latency-critical workers\", \"default_stance\": \"Explicit IO requests; mmap only prefetched/tool-side\", \"justification_owner\": \"async-io-storage\"}\n\nlegacy-patterns {\"id\": \"L18\", \"pattern\": \"Level-as-a-file loading\", \"detection\": \"whole level loaded before play\", \"default_stance\": \"Cell streaming with budgeted activation\", \"justification_owner\": \"world-architect\"}\n\nlegacy-patterns {\"id\": \"L19\", \"pattern\": \"Immediate synchronous observer callbacks across subsystems\", \"detection\": \"callbacks invoked on the producer's thread mid-update\", \"default_stance\": \"Deferred batched events at declared consumption points\", \"justification_owner\": \"entity-object-model\"}\n\nlegacy-patterns {\"id\": \"L20\", \"pattern\": \"Stringly-typed reflection on runtime paths\", \"detection\": \"name lookups per frame\", \"default_stance\": \"Static reflection & resolved IDs; strings at tool/script boundaries\", \"justification_owner\": \"reflection-metadata\"}\n\nlegacy-patterns {\"id\": \"L21\", \"pattern\": \"Tracing-GC-managed engine objects\", \"detection\": \"engine objects reachable via GC\", \"default_stance\": \"Explicit ownership + generational handles; weak script refs\", \"justification_owner\": \"entity-object-model\"}\n\nlegacy-patterns {\"id\": \"L22\", \"pattern\": \"Global script VM on one thread\", \"detection\": \"single interpreter mutating the world\", \"default_stance\": \"Per-worker VMs/isolates, deferred mutation\", \"justification_owner\": \"scripting-runtime\"}\n\nlegacy-patterns {\"id\": \"L23\", \"pattern\": \"Editor-in-runtime monolith\", \"detection\": \"editor code linked into shipping builds\", \"default_stance\": \"Tool-side modules; tools target only\", \"justification_owner\": \"editor-architect\"}\n\nlegacy-patterns {\"id\": \"L24\", \"pattern\": \"Blocking cook-before-play\", \"detection\": \"full cook required before running\", \"default_stance\": \"On-demand cooking & cook-server streaming\", \"justification_owner\": \"content-pipeline-architect\"}\n\nlegacy-patterns {\"id\": \"L25\", \"pattern\": \"Single-thread-first design\", \"detection\": \"systems that must run serially by construction\", \"default_stance\": \"Parallel by default; serial exceptions enumerated\", \"justification_owner\": \"architecture-governance\"}\n\nlegacy-patterns {\"id\": \"L26\", \"pattern\": \"Monolithic subsystems\", \"detection\": \"one module owning a whole domain\", \"default_stance\": \"Contracts + focused experts\", \"justification_owner\": \"engine-architect\"}\n\nlegacy-patterns {\"id\": \"L27\", \"pattern\": \"ECS for everything / GPU-driven everywhere (new dogma)\", \"detection\": \"technique applied where access patterns do not fit\", \"default_stance\": \"Per-domain ADR with workload evidence\", \"justification_owner\": \"architecture-governance\"}\n\nmilestones {\"id\": \"M0\", \"name\": \"Walking skeleton\", \"configuration\": \"indie-2d-client\", \"skills\": [\"platform-architect\", \"platform-desktop\", \"core-runtime-architect\", \"math-simd-numerics\", \"memory-allocators\", \"containers-core-types\", \"concurrency-primitives\", \"job-system-task-graph\", \"observability-telemetry\", \"crash-diagnostics\", \"runtime-scalability\", \"frame-orchestration\", \"entity-object-model\", \"reflection-metadata\", \"serialization-schema\", \"async-io-storage\", \"package-formats-vfs\", \"content-pipeline-architect\", \"resource-streaming-architect\", \"gpu-platform-architect\", \"rhi-core\", \"rhi-vulkan\", \"gpu-memory-resources\", \"render-graph-scheduling\", \"shader-system\", \"text-fonts\", \"render-2d-vector\", \"i\n\nmilestones {\"id\": \"M1\", \"name\": \"Indie 2D vertical slice\", \"configuration\": \"indie-2d-client\", \"skills\": [\"ecs-runtime\", \"spatial-transforms\", \"world-architect\", \"world-data-model\", \"determinism-replay\", \"physics-architect\", \"physics-2d\", \"animation-architect\", \"animation-runtime\", \"animation-graphs\", \"audio-architect\", \"audio-dsp-mixing\", \"audio-content-runtime\", \"localization-i18n\", \"accessibility\", \"ui-architect\", \"gameplay-architect\", \"gameplay-systems-toolkit\", \"gameplay-data\", \"scripting-runtime\", \"persistence-save\", \"character-movement\", \"render-architect\", \"material-system\", \"post-color-hdr\", \"texture-streaming-vt\", \"reconstruction-upscaling\", \"vfx-particles\", \"visual-debugging-tools\", \"plugin-\n\nmilestones {\"id\": \"M2\", \"name\": \"Standard 3D\", \"configuration\": \"standard-3d-client\", \"skills\": [\"geometry-pipeline\", \"virtualized-geometry-lod\", \"direct-lighting-shadows\", \"global-illumination\", \"ray-tracing-infrastructure\", \"translucency-decals\", \"atmosphere-weather\", \"terrain\", \"water-ocean\", \"vegetation-foliage\", \"collision-detection\", \"rigid-body-dynamics\", \"character-physics\", \"cloth-deformables\", \"ik-procedural-animation\", \"deformation-skinning\", \"facial-animation\", \"spatial-audio-acoustics\", \"character-rendering\", \"path-tracing\", \"rhi-d3d12\", \"rhi-metal\", \"platform-console\", \"platform-mobile\", \"collaboration-version-control\", \"destruction-fracture\"], \"exit\": \"The standard-3d reference game runs\n\nmilestones {\"id\": \"M3\", \"name\": \"Open world & large simulation\", \"configuration\": \"open-world-client\", \"skills\": [\"procedural-generation\", \"crowd-simulation\", \"motion-synthesis\", \"vehicle-physics\"], \"exit\": \"Open-world reference slice streams at target speed within the arbitration budget; massim configuration closed and benchmarked.\", \"contracts_frozen\": [\"C-WORLD\", \"C-SIGNIF\", \"C-ENV\"], \"contracts_draft\": []}\n\nmilestones {\"id\": \"M4\", \"name\": \"Online\", \"configuration\": \"online-3d-server\", \"skills\": [\"network-architect\", \"network-transport\", \"replication\", \"prediction-rollback\", \"dedicated-server\", \"anti-cheat-integrity\", \"online-services-liveops\"], \"exit\": \"Online reference game with dedicated server, prediction/rollback, bot load test and cert pre-checks for online features.\", \"contracts_frozen\": [\"C-NET\", \"C-NETLINK\", \"C-REP\", \"C-PREDICT\"], \"contracts_draft\": []}\n\nmilestones {\"id\": \"M5\", \"name\": \"AAA & ecosystem\", \"configuration\": \"aaa-open-world-online-client\", \"skills\": [\"ml-inference-runtime\", \"fluid-simulation\", \"modding-ugc\", \"xr-runtime\", \"platform-web\", \"rhi-webgpu\", \"ai-assisted-authoring\", \"voxel-worlds\"], \"exit\": \"AAA reference slice; mods; XR; web; ML features behind optional contracts.\", \"contracts_frozen\": [], \"contracts_draft\": [\"C-ML\", \"C-MLGPU\"]}\n\ncritics {\"id\": \"K-ARCH\", \"name\": \"Engine Architecture Critic\", \"mandate\": \"Architectural completeness and subsystem boundaries: ownership overlaps, missing contracts, wrong layering, contracts that leak internals, hierarchy that does not match coupling.\", \"checks\": [\"every capability has exactly one owner and the owner is the right expertise\", \"non-responsibilities point to the real owner\", \"contracts are minimal, stable and layered\", \"no hidden cyclic build dependencies\", \"leads have real territory, not just coordination\"], \"scope\": [\"all\", \"tier:orchestrator\", \"research-evidence\", \"subtree:api-lifecycle-migration\", \"subtree:world-architect\", \"developer-experience-docs\"], \"stages\": [\"G1\", \"G2\", \"S1\n\ncritics {\"id\": \"K-RENDER\", \"name\": \"Rendering Critic\", \"mandate\": \"Graphics architecture and currency of rendering techniques; GPU-driven, bindless, explicit-API assumptions; scalability from 2D mobile to path tracing.\", \"checks\": [\"no draw-call-centric or DX11-era assumptions\", \"render graph owns sync and aliasing\", \"technique maturity labels are honest\", \"scale-down path exists for each feature\"], \"scope\": [\"subtree:render-architect\", \"render-validation\", \"gpu-performance\", \"terrain\", \"vegetation-foliage\", \"water-ocean\", \"atmosphere-weather\", \"deformation-skinning\", \"xr-runtime\", \"ml-inference-runtime\", \"subtree:gpu-platform-architect\", \"media-playback\", \"voxel-worlds\", \"platform-console\"], \"stage\n\ncritics {\"id\": \"K-SYSTEMS\", \"name\": \"Systems Critic\", \"mandate\": \"Concurrency, memory, scheduling, IO and low-level architecture.\", \"checks\": [\"no single-thread-first assumptions\", \"explicit ownership and lifetimes\", \"synchronization minimized and justified\", \"async IO end to end\", \"heterogeneous cores and NUMA considered\"], \"scope\": [\"subtree:core-runtime-architect\", \"subtree:resource-streaming-architect\", \"observability-telemetry\", \"crash-diagnostics\", \"determinism-replay\", \"hot-reload-iteration\", \"rhi-core\", \"gpu-memory-resources\", \"render-graph-scheduling\", \"audio-architect\", \"network-transport\", \"ml-inference-runtime\", \"subtree:world-architect\", \"subtree:gpu-platform-architect\", \"runtime-scalab\n\ncritics {\"id\": \"K-SIM\", \"name\": \"Physics & Simulation Critic\", \"mandate\": \"Simulation domains: physics, destruction, fluids, cloth, crowds, large-scale simulation, determinism of simulation.\", \"checks\": [\"stepping and sync with frame phases are explicit\", \"determinism levels are declared\", \"simulation LOD exists for large scales\", \"build-vs-integrate evidence\"], \"scope\": [\"subtree:physics-architect\", \"crowd-simulation\", \"ik-procedural-animation\", \"prediction-rollback\", \"determinism-replay\", \"procedural-generation\", \"water-ocean\", \"vfx-particles\", \"character-movement\", \"simulation-validation\", \"voxel-worlds\"], \"stages\": [\"G1\", \"G2\", \"S1\", \"S2\", \"S3\", \"S4\"]}\n\ncritics {\"id\": \"K-NET\", \"name\": \"Networking Critic\", \"mandate\": \"Online and multiplayer architecture: models, replication, prediction, servers, security, online-service boundaries.\", \"checks\": [\"netcode model matches game type\", \"authority and trust explicit\", \"bandwidth and scale budgets\", \"version compatibility\", \"service boundaries clear\"], \"scope\": [\"subtree:network-architect\", \"anti-cheat-integrity\", \"platform-services\", \"destruction-fracture\", \"persistence-save\", \"packaging-release-patching\", \"character-movement\", \"online-services-liveops\", \"narrative-dialogue\"], \"stages\": [\"G1\", \"G2\", \"S1\", \"S2\", \"S3\", \"S4\"]}\n\ncritics {\"id\": \"K-TOOLS\", \"name\": \"Tools & Editor Critic\", \"mandate\": \"Production tooling and content workflows: editor, pipeline, collaboration, iteration speed.\", \"checks\": [\"tooling as thorough as runtime\", \"undo/transactions universal\", \"large teams can collaborate without lock contention\", \"iteration time measured\", \"pipeline deterministic and cached\"], \"scope\": [\"subtree:editor-architect\", \"subtree:content-pipeline-architect\", \"hot-reload-iteration\", \"developer-experience-docs\", \"ui-architect\", \"terrain\", \"procedural-generation\", \"cinematics-sequencer\", \"scripting-runtime\", \"world-data-model\", \"subtree:build-release-architect\", \"owns-area:TOOL\", \"kind:tool\"], \"stages\": [\"G1\", \"G2\", \"S1\", \"S2\",\n\ncritics {\"id\": \"K-PLATFORM\", \"name\": \"Platform Critic\", \"mandate\": \"Hardware, operating systems, consoles, graphics APIs, packaging and platform requirements.\", \"checks\": [\"PAL is the only platform-specific layer\", \"console, mobile and web constraints represented\", \"certification requirements traced\", \"packaging and patching per platform\"], \"scope\": [\"subtree:platform-architect\", \"rhi-core\", \"subtree:build-release-architect\", \"certification-compliance\", \"async-io-storage\", \"crash-diagnostics\", \"rhi-d3d12\", \"rhi-vulkan\", \"rhi-metal\", \"rhi-webgpu\"], \"stages\": [\"G1\", \"G2\", \"S1\", \"S2\", \"S4\", \"S3\"]}\n\ncritics {\"id\": \"K-PERF\", \"name\": \"Performance Critic\", \"mandate\": \"Scalability bottlenecks: serialization points, excess synchronization, cache inefficiency, GPU stalls, bandwidth, poor asymptotics.\", \"checks\": [\"budgets exist for each subsystem\", \"benchmarks include realistic workloads\", \"no hidden global sync points\", \"asymptotics stated for world-scale data\"], \"scope\": [\"all\", \"subtree:performance-architect\", \"subtree:world-architect\", \"runtime-scalability\"], \"stages\": [\"G1\", \"G2\", \"S2\", \"S3\", \"S4\"]}\n\ncritics {\"id\": \"K-PROD\", \"name\": \"Production Critic\", \"mandate\": \"Could a real team ship games with this: workflows, content scale, team scale, schedules, live operations.\", \"checks\": [\"content creators are first-class\", \"features have an owner through ship\", \"live-ops and patching covered\", \"scale-down keeps small teams productive\"], \"scope\": [\"all\", \"tier:orchestrator\", \"developer-experience-docs\", \"subtree:build-release-architect\", \"engine-product-management\", \"reference-games\"], \"stages\": [\"G1\", \"G2\", \"S4\"]}\n\ncritics {\"id\": \"K-FUTURE\", \"name\": \"Future-Technology Critic\", \"mandate\": \"Does the architecture block likely next-5-year technologies: neural rendering, work graphs, cluster RT, ML animation, new storage and memory, new platforms.\", \"checks\": [\"extension points exist for emerging techniques\", \"maturity labels allow promotion\", \"no hard-coding of today's API limits\"], \"scope\": [\"all\"], \"stages\": [\"G1\", \"G2\", \"S1\"]}\n\ncritics {\"id\": \"K-COMPLETE\", \"name\": \"Completeness Critic\", \"mandate\": \"Exactly one responsibility: find engine capabilities or engineering disciplines that are missing.\", \"checks\": [\"compare against shipped engines' feature sets\", \"compare against platform requirements\", \"compare against production pipelines end to end\"], \"scope\": [\"all\"], \"stages\": [\"G1\", \"G2\"]}\n\ncritics {\"id\": \"K-LEGACY\", \"name\": \"Anti-Legacy Critic\", \"mandate\": \"Find accidental legacy architecture: central sequential update loops, deep inheritance, global state, hot-path virtual dispatch, CPU-driven rendering, coarse locks, global renderer sync, frame-tied lifetimes, universal scene graphs, synchronous IO/loading, single-thread-first design, OpenGL/DX11 assumptions, monoliths. A flagged pattern needs justification, not removal.\", \"checks\": [\"each pattern in data/legacy-patterns.json absent or justified by an ADR\"], \"scope\": [\"all\"], \"stages\": [\"G1\", \"G2\", \"S1\", \"S2\", \"S3\", \"S4\"]}\n\ncritics {\"id\": \"K-GAMEPLAY\", \"name\": \"Game Systems & Content Critic\", \"mandate\": \"Animation, audio, AI, gameplay framework, UI, text, localization and accessibility: whether game teams get what they need.\", \"checks\": [\"designers and animators have authoring paths\", \"accessibility and localization built in, not bolted on\", \"gameplay extension points\"], \"scope\": [\"subtree:animation-architect\", \"subtree:audio-architect\", \"subtree:gameplay-architect\", \"subtree:ui-architect\", \"accessibility\", \"input-system\", \"input-devices-haptics\", \"character-physics\", \"cinematics-sequencer\"], \"stages\": [\"G1\", \"G2\", \"S1\", \"S2\", \"S4\", \"S3\"]}\n\ncritics {\"id\": \"K-TEST\", \"name\": \"Testing & Validation Critic\", \"mandate\": \"Validation, oracles, determinism and concurrency testing, agent-output integrity: can an independent critic objectively decide correctness?\", \"checks\": [\"each skill has objective validation with an independent oracle\", \"tests cannot be weakened silently\", \"determinism & concurrency testable via seams\", \"evidence bundle defined for S3/S4\"], \"scope\": [\"all\", \"subtree:test-architect\", \"subtree:performance-architect\"], \"stages\": [\"G1\", \"G2\", \"S1\", \"S2\", \"S3\", \"S4\"]}\n\ncritics {\"id\": \"K-SEC\", \"name\": \"Security Critic\", \"mandate\": \"Threat model, trust boundaries, memory safety, supply chain, privacy, incident response \\u2014 reviewed at design time as well as in code.\", \"checks\": [\"every untrusted input has a validating owner and a fuzz target\", \"trust boundaries explicit\", \"hardening & key custody\", \"privacy of telemetry, crash and player data\"], \"scope\": [\"all\", \"subtree:security-engineering\", \"network-transport\", \"scripting-runtime\", \"modding-ugc\", \"plugin-system\", \"serialization-schema\", \"package-formats-vfs\", \"persistence-save\", \"platform-services\", \"online-services-liveops\", \"packaging-release-patching\", \"ci-cd-automation\", \"build-system-toolchains\", \"observa","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"5418235f-2831-47e5-895d-9783379cdd42","timestamp":"2026-09-29T16:21:24.339Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"b414c198-1813-4d0c-b632-5b3f8a11a571","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1"}
