{"parentUuid":"f3466503-dc27-4886-8c01-5efeb8ee4fcc","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"9bdfc07b-8ff1-4e95-9c88-de7440fd6192","agentId":"a247aee484158d5cb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017tgQH3tvKGdxcdsNgk2wbC","type":"tool_result","content":"memory management [\"CORE.MEM.virtual\", \"CORE.MEM.oom\"]\nstreaming [\"RES.MGMT.streaming\"]\nlevel streaming [\"WLD.PART.sources\"]\naudio streaming [\"AUD.DSP.streaming\"]\nsimultaneous multithreading [\"CORE.JOBS.hetero\"]\nintegrated GPUs [\"RND.RHI.caps\", \"CORE.MEM.uma\"]\nwork graphs or equivalent execution models [\"RND.GRAPH.work-graphs\"]\nunified memory architectures [\"CORE.MEM.uma\", \"PLAT.CON.os-memory\"]\nNUMA [\"CORE.JOBS.numa\", \"CORE.MEM.thread-caches\"]\nconsoles [\"PLAT.CON.os-memory\"]\nconsole-class architectures [\"PLAT.CON.os-memory\"]\nmemory performance [\"PRF.MEM.footprint\"]\ndata/capabilities.json:3121:       \"RND.ARCH.instance-data\",\ndocs/01-capability-map.md:554:- `RND.ARCH.instance-data` GPU instance data layout & delta upload — **render-architect**\ndocs/03-skill-hierarchy.md:1114:- **Owns:** `RND.ARCH.pipeline`; `RND.ARCH.shading-path`; `RND.ARCH.feature-contract`; `RND.ARCH.scene-sync`; `RND.ARCH.scalability`; `RND.ARCH.multiview`; `RND.ARCH.debug-modes`; `RND.ARCH.submission-strategy`; `RND.ARCH.editor-rendering`; `RND.ARCH.instance-data`","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"d272a479-6ba1-408e-9fd9-26366fec9006","timestamp":"2026-09-29T16:22:44.932Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f3466503-dc27-4886-8c01-5efeb8ee4fcc","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1","slug":"warm-pondering-kernighan"}
