{"parentUuid":"c1ae4b52-f8a8-4d7f-b61d-21087ed53cfa","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a247aee484158d5cb","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfY3LExtchCJyXDHyWzk6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"14 findings: 1 blocker, 9 major, 4 minor, written to `/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-skills/64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82/scratchpad/r2/engine-skill-framework/gauntlet/round-2/K-PERF.md`\n\nThe four most severe (blocker first):\n- **Blocker, K-PERF-1:** nothing owns cross-pool memory arbitration. The rationale document, `RND.MEM.residency`, gap A14 and the M3 exit criterion all point at an arbiter (`RES.MGMT.arbitration`), but no such capability exists.\n- **K-PERF-2:** the frame-pipelining capability specifies a dedicated game thread and render thread, and `CORE.FRAME.phases` specifies phase barriers. Both contradict the framework's own defaults, and three skills now claim the render-threading model.\n- **K-PERF-3:** GPU instance data layout and delta upload have two owners (`render-architect` and `geometry-pipeline`).\n- **K-PERF-4:** `RND.GRAPH.work-graphs` is labelled established, while `radar.json` classifies it as experimental.\n\nThe other six majors:\n- **K-PERF-5:** the runtime governor sits at layer 1. Its frame-time and GPU-time signals can only reach it through instrumentation, which is compiled out in shipping builds.\n- **K-PERF-6:** no one arbitrates per-frame transfer and upload bandwidth. GPU decompression can't be scheduled against the render graph.\n- **K-PERF-7:** in-process measurement code (benchmark runner, memory snapshots, GPU capture) belongs to skills with no build targets, so configuration closure can't prove a benchmark runs in any configuration.\n- **K-PERF-8:** replication has no change-driven or per-connection cost obligation.\n- **K-PERF-9:** no independent analyst covers network and server performance; the implementers grade themselves.\n- **K-PERF-10:** the milestones have no performance exit criteria, even though the design says budgets exist before features.\n\nThe minors: overlapping editor-budget ownership, no profile build configuration, no pacing and latency analyst, and no access-order package layout.\n\n`check.py` passes with 0 errors and 0 warnings. It can't detect any of these."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10539,"cache_read_input_tokens":202216,"output_tokens":794,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":10539},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":794,"cache_read_input_tokens":202216,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10539,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":10539,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfY3LEfHc6V3WgdHUUMic","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"44a2ef3e-6e66-4730-beff-b9ded01ef6d4","timestamp":"2026-09-29T16:24:32.865Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1","slug":"warm-pondering-kernighan"}
